        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "Simple, ordinary, and universal kriging",
        "statement": "For a finite square-integrable field vector, define the simple predictor using known means, ordinary kriging using an unknown constant mean and sum-to-one weights, and universal kriging using a finite trend design and its unbiasedness constraint.",
