        "id": "thm-kriging-systems-and-l2-optimality",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Kriging systems and mean-square optimality",
        "statement": "With positive-definite observation covariance, simple kriging has weights Sigma^{-1}c0 and error v0-c0^T Sigma^{-1}c0. For an unknown finite trend with full-column-rank design, the unique unbiased minimum-error weights and multiplier solve the augmented covariance system, whose invertibility and error formula are proved locally.",
